><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250516121918+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250516121921+10'00'" name="591aee32-1e7c-46bc-a2d0-2296b3d88a35" page="5" coords="306.688293,558.039917,553.260925,558.039917,306.688293,547.239929,553.260925,547.239929,306.688293,547.041931,553.269897,547.041931,306.688293,536.241943,553.269897,536.241943,306.688293,536.043945,553.288391,536.043945,306.688293,525.243958,553.288391,525.243958,306.688293,525.045959,553.260620,525.045959,306.688293,514.245972,553.260620,514.245972,306.688293,514.047974,553.258911,514.047974,306.688293,503.247986,553.258911,503.247986,306.688293,503.049988,553.296875,503.049988,306.688293,492.250000,553.296875,492.250000,306.688293,492.052002,553.283569,492.052002,306.688293,481.252014,553.283569,481.252014,306.688293,481.054016,553.314880,481.054016,306.688293,470.254028,553.314880,470.254028,306.688293,470.056030,553.270203,470.055847,306.688293,459.256042,553.270203,459.255890,306.688263,459.057922,553.251831,459.057922,306.688263,448.257935,553.251831,448.257935,306.688263,448.059937,553.260315,448.059937,306.688263,437.259949,553.260315,437.259949,306.688263,437.061951,553.291260,437.061951,306.688263,426.261963,553.291260,426.261963,306.688263,426.063965,553.260681,426.063965,306.688263,415.263977,553.260681,415.263977,306.688263,415.065979,553.279175,415.065979,306.688263,404.265991,553.279175,404.265991,306.688263,404.067993,553.279053,404.067993,306.688263,393.268005,553.279053,393.268005,306.688263,393.070007,416.568848,393.070007,306.688263,382.270020,416.568848,382.270020" rect="306.350769,381.932495,553.652405,558.377441" subject="Comment on Text" title="alexd"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Sports medicine doctors working with elite athletes prescribe&#xD;glucocorticoid medications commonly, so increasing restrictions&#xD;on glucocorticoid administration would have a large&#xD;impact on the way sports doctors around the world practise&#xD;medicine. The current WADA regulations limit the use of&#xD;glucocorticoids by certain routes, but application for a TUE&#xD;is possible where there is a documented clinical indication&#xD;for use. There is a clear need for additional education of&#xD;staff providing medical services to high-performance&#xD;athletes&#xD;worldwide regarding the permitted use of glucocorticoids in&#xD;sports and the circumstances under which one should consider&#xD;application for a TUE. Additional research on different glucocorticoids&#xD;pharmacodynamics and excretion rates would help&#xD;determine when physicians can comfortably prescribe glucocorticoids&#xD;(from a doping perspective) and when a TUE application&#xD;should be submitted.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="5" rect="595.276001,466.039917,779.276001,558.039917"
/></highlight
